flowchart TD
    OPEN["OPEN<br/>Liquidity doesn't have to be all-in"]:::user

    OPEN --> SETUP["1 — Setup<br/>Maker wallet with 100 ETH<br/>Two Aqua positions, λ = 20%<br/>Same group, shared Γ"]:::core

    SETUP --> SHOW_LOCAL["2 — Show Local λ<br/>Position A: 20 ETH / 80k USDC active<br/>Position B: 20 ETH / 80k USDC active<br/>Both look fully executable"]:::data

    SHOW_LOCAL --> EXEC_A["3 — Execute Position A<br/>Exact-in swap consumes<br/>group budget partially"]:::swapvm

    EXEC_A --> ATTEMPT_B["4 — Attempt Position B<br/>Exact-out above remaining Γ<br/>→ GroupActiveLiquidityExceeded"]:::risk

    ATTEMPT_B --> PUNCHLINE["DEMO SENTENCE<br/>This second order looks locally<br/>executable, but the shared wallet<br/>envelope has already been consumed.<br/>AquaValve tells the solver before<br/>settlement would revert."]:::highlight

    PUNCHLINE --> RETRY["5 — Retry B smaller<br/>Exact-out within remaining Γ<br/>→ Real ERC-20 transfer succeeds"]:::core

    RETRY --> COV_DROP["6 — Coverage Drop<br/>Maker transfers some ETH out<br/>→ Quote shrinks proportionally<br/>→ quote() still returns, no brick"]:::warn

    COV_DROP --> DECAY_COMP["7 — Decay Composition<br/>Run same sequence through:<br/>XYC only → DECAY+XYC<br/>→ ACTIVENESS+XYC<br/>→ ACTIVENESS+DECAY+XYC"]:::swapvm

    DECAY_COMP --> GRAPH_LAYER["8 — The Graph Layer (if ready)<br/>Query live capacity surface<br/>Show active vs inactive reserves<br/>per block"]:::data

    GRAPH_LAYER --> CLOSE["CLOSE<br/>AquaValve turns Aqua shared<br/>liquidity from soft virtual promises<br/>into programmable live capacity"]:::user

